; `pushmeta` puts a key/value on a stack; every directive parsed after it
; carries that key until a matching `popmeta`. Directives that set the key
; themselves keep their own value — the pushed one only fills a gap.
;
; The pushes nest, so each key holds a stack of its own and the innermost push
; wins.
pushmeta project: "renovation"
